  sig=func a11yPayloadCommand() string
  doc=a11yPayloadCommand returns the shell that decodes and runs the AT-SPI dumper.\nThe script is base64-carried so its Python survives nested shell quoting.
EDGES
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/dojo/a11y.go

